'''Bones''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Halloween Event 2016#Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2016]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is light gray in color with many skulls imprinted in black on it. The guard and handle are solid black.

==Trivia ==
*This knife was obtained from the first Halloween event box ever in [[Murder Mystery 2]].

